  ✓  Model appointment_request wins over service keywords present in caller text
  ✓  Pure service request (no visit intent) is preserved without upgrading to appointment
  ✓  General question (no visit/service intent) — model result produces no records

Suite 9: looksLikePhone — phone-turn detection
  ✓  phone numbers (various formats) → true
  ✓  time/date/word turns → false
  ✓  too-short / too-long digit runs → false

